          <h2>Cryptocurrency with Polaris</h2>
          <p class="pf-lead">At Polaris Finance, we make cryptocurrency investing more accessible by offering carefully curated exposure to digital assets. From established cryptocurrencies and stablecoins to high-potential altcoins, we help clients participate in one of the most dynamic asset classes of our time while maintaining a disciplined, risk-aware approach.</p>

          <p>Cryptocurrency provides unique opportunities for portfolio growth through capital appreciation, 24/7 market access, and the potential for strong risk-adjusted returns. It also offers diversification benefits, as digital assets often move independently of traditional stocks and bonds.</p>

          <p>With Polaris Finance, you gain access to a professionally managed cryptocurrency allocation that prioritizes security, transparency, and long-term value creation. We focus on quality assets, robust custody solutions, and clear reporting so you can invest with confidence.</p>

          <div class="pf-highlights">
            <div class="pf-highlight">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
              <strong>Secure custody</strong>
              <span>Assets held with institutional-grade cold storage and multi-signature controls.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pf-highlight">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg>
              <strong>Active management</strong>
              <span>Allocations rebalanced by our analysts as market conditions change.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pf-highlight">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path d="m7 15 4-4 3 3 5-6"></path></svg>
